      "cooked": "<p>Aha! I wondered why Adam wasn’t streaming yesterday, I guess this must be a Necrosis event or something.</p>\n<p>This opening banter is stellar. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Why does the talk about rock climbing feel ominous? :')</p>\n<p>So he’s a smusk? Might he be a long one? :V</p>\n<p>The Humorest is low-key a good name though. XD</p>\n<p>Short story, but I think we got enough to fulfill the prompt if nothing else!</p>\n<p>“And Sk8blayd has a Writer’s Room” You say that like it’s a bad thing! V:&lt;</p>\n<p>So Necrosis is Darth Vader, got it.</p>\n<p>omg, the Sk8blayd h8, he’s literally just a guy?? D:</p>\n<p>At last! Another hero who is properly XTREEEEEM! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>You’re telling me he was Dio all a-Zhu Long?</p>\n<p>If Deathcon became Deathfiend, the deaths would cancel out and he’d just be Confiend. :B</p>\n<p>See, the musical stings are why I keep listening to this podcast. :V</p>",
